  "description": "K-way external merge sort for .NET 8. Sort datasets larger than available memory using binary min-heap merge. v1.0.3 adds pipelined parallel chunk creation, Knuth's Replacement Selection (~2x larger runs), and a ReplaceMin merge fast path (30-34% faster). Generic IExternalSorter<T> — plug in any record type, comparer, and serializer.",
